{"subject":"Math","notes":["When we add two numbers, we line them up so the ones place and tens place are in the same columns.","In 24 + 13, write 24 on top and 13 below it, with the ones digits (4 and 3) lined up on the right.","First, add the ones column: 4 + 3 = 7. Write 7 in the ones place of your answer.","Next, add the tens column: 2 + 1 = 3. Write 3 in the tens place of your answer.","Your answer is 37. You can check by counting: start at 24 and count up 13 more: 25, 26, 27... up to 37."]}
